[559.270599, "o", "ref       : (11.31158447265625, 11.300671577453613)\r\ncublas32  : (10.687456130981445, 10.682080268859863)\r\ntriton tf32x3 BM128 BN128 BK64 nw8 ns3: (5.739871978759766, 5.727903842926025) maxdiff=8.70e-06 ok=True\r\nfail 128 128 64 8 4 tf32x3 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262144, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `num_stages` may help.\r\nfail 128 256 64 8 3 tf32x3 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327680, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `num_stages` may help.\r\nfail 64 256 64 8 4 tf32x3 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 376832, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `num_stages` may help.\r\ntriton tf32x3 BM128 BN64 BK64 nw4 ns4: (13.707584381103516, 13.67734432220459) maxdiff=8.70e-06 ok=True\r\ntriton tf32x3 BM128 BN128 BK32 nw8 ns4: (6.850143909454346, 6.819039821624756) maxdiff=9.06e-06 ok=True\r\ntf32x3 worst maxdiff=1.061e-05, worst ratio-to-threshold=0.0500\r\nfail 128 128 64 8 8 3 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262160, Hardware limit: 232"]
[559.270748, "o", "448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\nfail 128 128 64 8 8 4 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327704, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\nfail 128 256 64 8 8 3 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 458768, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\nfail 256 128 64 8 8 3 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 393232, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\nfail 128 128 128 8 8 2 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 327688, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\nfail 128 256 128 8 8 3 out of resource: shared memory, Required: 786448, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `n\r\n"]
